- JWT now verified locally to eliminate mass logouts under high load
- Cross-project Motion access from personal workspace
- Motion private pages with space-level sharing controls
- AI supervisor now includes a CRM subagent and contact enrichment agent
- Adaptive model-tiering gate added to AI chat for cost efficiency
- Sidebar tiles now responsive across all viewport widths
- Auth, CRM, and dashboard routing stabilized
